<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\手直し・追加\七海荘昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"This apartment's next."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―People actually live in a shack like this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Never mind that, let's go."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Coming!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\屋上ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, um, we're police officers."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Police officers?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah. You know there was an incident the other day, right?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! Yes, the culprit is me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―What!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is that so. Is your dad or mom home?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s out shopping?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see. If <STYLE ID="2">your mom</STYLE> comes home, could you give her this paper?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It has the police's contact information written on it. Tell her we'd like her to let us know if she knows anything about the incident the other day."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I told you, the culprit is me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―No way, was it really <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes! See, with these paper dolls!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="久慈浩二">Koji Kuji</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Kokona <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="畑中">Hatanaka</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Senpai, could <STYLE ID="1">this kid</STYLE> be...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, would you happen to be <STYLE ID="2">her mother</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, haven't I told you not to open the door when someone you don't know comes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Um, is there something you need from us...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, we're from the police. We've been making door-to-door inquiries about that incident."<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\paper-round1_.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what did you just hide?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Nothing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
"Ah, um, <STYLE ID="2">ma'am</STYLE>, all I did a moment ago was give her a paper with the police's contact information on it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is that true?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... that's all."</STYLE><PG>
"Excuse me, <STYLE ID="2">ma'am</STYLE>, but where were you on April 8?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"My </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I went to my </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">husband</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s third-year memorial service. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I'm sorry, but the time of the incident... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">um, it was around 16:00, wasn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, 16:00."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's just when we were on the train. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">We'd been out of the house since morning, so I'm sorry, but nothing..."</STYLE><PG>
"I see. If you notice anything, please contact us."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"All right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well then, excuse us."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\door2_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルト歩くずれ用.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
―<STYLE ID="1">That kid</STYLE> had the victims' paper dolls...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Watch out for that kind of thing."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yes! I'll keep a close watch on her!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's not what I mean. After a case like that, now and then you get someone who declares they're the culprit. 
{PAUSE ""}
They want attention."<PG>
―Ah... I see... The victims' names have been in the news, after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The one just now was a kid, so it was easy to tell, but once they're adults it gets to be a real pain. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's not like you can get away with not bringing them in."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Yes, I'll keep that in mind.
